# Generated, vendored, or oracle-derived. Prettier must not touch any of it:
# `docs/catalog.md` is generated and drift-gated (`npm run catalog`), the
# stdlib/sprite payloads are byte-verbatim vendored copies audited against a
# manifest, and every JSON under `oracle/goldens/` and `tests/oracle/` is a
# measurement pinned by a gate -- reformatting one is a re-pin.
dist/
dist-demo/
coverage/
node_modules/
assets/stdlib/
assets/sprites/
packages/*/generated/
test-results/
tests/corpus/
tests/visual/
docs/catalog.md
oracle/goldens/
tests/oracle/svg-conformance/parity*.json
package-lock.json

# Prose artifacts, hand-wrapped and full of alignment-sensitive tables,
# upstream `file:line` citations and fenced PlantUML. Reflowing them is pure
# churn against documents whose line breaks are deliberate.
.agent-notes/
plans/
docs/
findings/
planning/
*.md
